    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "By Private Treaty\r\nPatrick Street/Chapel Avenue Ballyragget Co Kilkenny\r\nAttention Builders/Investors\r\nAvailable in Three Lots\r\nGuide Price €400,000\r\nViewing with Auctioneer By Appointment\r\nSale of substantial three storey building in central location standing on circa 0.754 of an acre, with large enclosed private yard and garden area.\r\nLot 1: Guide Price €225,000. Three storey building 6,677 sq. ft., situated on a fine corner site overlooking The Square/ High Street. The property consists of a number of large size rooms with open fireplaces.  The property has huge development potential for a multitude of uses.\r\nLot 2: Guide Price €175,000.  Yard and garden 0.612 of an acre, with vehicle access onto Chapel Avenue.  Derelict old stone building formally Coach house incorporating old stone arches. Large garden area to the rear of the Coach house.\r\nLot 3: The Entire.\r\nEir Code R95 R8X2. Situated in Ballyragget town centre within walking distance of all daily amenities, approximately 5 miles Durrow, 7 miles Castlecomer, 10 miles Kilkenny city centre, 11 miles Abbeyleix."
      },
